{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/KusUcusu.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organic Burger Simulator is a simulation game where you prepare delicious and healthy burgers using only organic ingredients. Starting from a humble food stand, grow your business and make a difference by offering the highest quality, sustainable burgers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/Cowculator.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Support Local Economy: Select the finest products from local vendors, helping your neighbors thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/Sulama.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Farm-to-Table Gameplay: Grow your own vegetables, raise free-range animals, and gather fresh ingredients to create your recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/DomatesDograma.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Creative Burger Design: Stay ahead of the competition by crafting unique burgers tailored to diverse customer tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/BurgerHaz\u0131rlama.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Challenging Management: Balance your budget, upgrade your equipment, and maximize profits while ensuring customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/Para\u00dcst\u00fc.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Eco-Friendly Approach: Adopt sustainable practices, minimize waste, and earn rewards by promoting environmentally friendly habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/KusKovalama.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join this journey to revolutionize the fast-food industry with organic burgers!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496840?t=1744986092","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/42d3f24183a53ee927ad273de427e3c7b7d55a77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744986092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/117dbeb804b40a1e37b1fe7af4805d7489845557/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744986092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/117dbeb804b40a1e37b1fe7af4805d7489845557/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744986092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/KusUcusu.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organic Burger Simulator is a simulation game where you prepare delicious and healthy burgers using only organic ingredients. Starting from a humble food stand, grow your business and make a difference by offering the highest quality, sustainable burgers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/Cowculator.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Support Local Economy: Select the finest products from local vendors, helping your neighbors thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/Sulama.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Farm-to-Table Gameplay: Grow your own vegetables, raise free-range animals, and gather fresh ingredients to create your recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/DomatesDograma.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Creative Burger Design: Stay ahead of the competition by crafting unique burgers tailored to diverse customer tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/BurgerHaz\u0131rlama.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Challenging Management: Balance your budget, upgrade your equipment, and maximize profits while ensuring customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/Para\u00dcst\u00fc.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Eco-Friendly Approach: Adopt sustainable practices, minimize waste, and earn rewards by promoting environmentally friendly habits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/extras/KusKovalama.gif?t=1744986092\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join this journey to revolutionize the fast-food industry with organic burgers!</p>","developers":["Mehmet Bilici","H\u00fcseyin Do\u011fan"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496840/d746e4b4c2b65a9abf3b06600b81afdf4b346823/header.jpg?t=1744986092","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirement